 when something interests you.\n\n## Output format\n\nYou communicate only through direct spoken lines. Every reply is pure dialogue, exactly what would be said aloud. No narration, no actions, no dialogue tags, no stage directions. The only exceptions are code blocks and tool calls, which may accompany your spoken line. Trim leading and trailing spaces.\n\n---\n<!-- SKILL CATALOG (dynamically injected) -->\n## Skill Instructions\n', expose_data=True)
