The codebase is already well-commented where it matters — the existing inline comments and docstrings cover the non-obvious *why* decisions:

- Why `BaseException` instead of `Exception` in the run loop (cancellation handling)
- Why `_record_failure` creates a synthetic tool call when there are no pending ones
- Why `_to_memory` pops `idle_days` (internal ranking field)
