ponentBehavior: Bound\n\nimport QtQuick\nimport QtQuick.Layouts\nimport "../generic"\n\nRectangle {\n  id: root\n\n  property string current: "Home"\n  readonly property var pages: ["Home", "Reservations", "Rooms", "About"]\n  readonly property color accent: "#E8B84F"\n\n  signal navigate(string page)\n\n  Layout.fillWidth: true\n  Layout.preferredHeight: 70\n  color: "white"\n\n  // Hairline under the bar\n  Rectangle {\n    anchors.bottom: parent.bottom\n    width: parent.width\n    height: 1\n    color: "#E4E4E4"\n  }\n\n  RowLayout {\n    anchors.fill: parent\n    anchors.leftMargin: 40\n    anchors.rightMargin: 40\n    spacing: 8\n\n    Image {\n      source: "../../images/header_logo.png"\n      fillMode: Image.PreserveAspectCrop\n      horizontalAlignment: Image.AlignLeft\n      Layout.preferredWidth: 220\n      Layout.preferredHeight: parent.height - 20\n      Layout.alignment: Qt.AlignVCenter\n    }\n\n    // Pushes the links and button to the right\n    Item {\n      Layout.fillWidth: true\n    }\n\n    Repeater {\n      model: root.pages\n\n      NavLink {\n        required property string modelData\n\n        Layout.fillHeight: true\n        text: modelData\n        active: modelData === root.current\n        accent: root.accent\n        onClicked: root.navigate(modelData)\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Alright, let\'s break it down.\n\n## NavLink — what it is\n\nIt\'s a reusable navigation tab/link component. It renders a text label with an animated underline that appears when the link is **active** or being hovered.\n\n---\n\n### Properties you set\n\n| Property | Type | Default | What it does |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| `text` | `string` | `"Link"` | The label shown on the link |\n| `active` | `bool` | `false` | Whether this link is the currently selected one (underline visible) |\n| `accent` | `color` | `"#E8B84F"` | Color of the underline bar |\n\n### Signal\n\n| Signal | When it fires |\n|-----