2026-10-07 21:05:01 | DEBUG    | modules.agents.models:136 | Say (full): [Agent Amadeus] Right, you want the QML. Here's the full `RoomCard.qml` with the hover overlay wired to show reviews from the model.

First, on the **Python side**, add one field to `RoomModel` so QML can read the preview reviews:

```python
# modules/gui/models.py — in RoomModel
@pyqtProperty("QVariant", constant=True)
def previewReviews(self):
    return self._previewReviews
```

And in `from_row`:

```python
@classmethod
def from_row(cls, row, tier, reviews):
    # ... existing code ...
    previews = []
    for r in sorted(reviews, key=lambda x: x.id or 0, reverse=True)[:3]:
        previews.append({
            "rating": r.rating,
            "text": r.text,
            "userName": getattr(r, "user_name", "Anonymous") or "Anonymous",
        })
    model._previewReviews = previews
    return model
```

Now the **QML** — here's your `RoomCard.qml` with the overlay added at the bottom:

```qml
import QtQuick
import QtQuick.Layouts
import QtQuick.Effects

Rectangle {
  id: root

  required property int index
  required property int number
  required property string tierName
  required property string description
  required property int capacity
  required property real unitPrice
  required property real basePrice
  required property real totalPrice
  required property bool isMaintenance
  required property url imagePath
  required property real averageRating
  required property int reviewCount
  required property var previewReviews

  Layout.fillWidth: true
  Layout.preferredWidth: 100
  implicitHeight: column.implicitHeight + 24
  radius: 16
  color: "white"
  border.color: "#E4E4E4"
  opacity: root.isMaintenance ? 0.6 : 1.0

  scale: hover.hovered ? 1.1 : 1

  Behavior on scale {
    NumberAnimation {
      duration: 100
      easing.type: Easing.InOutSine
    }
  }

  // ─── Main content ───
  ColumnLayout {
    id: column

    anchors.fill: parent
    anchors.margins: 12
    spacing: 10

    Rectangle {
      Layout.fillWidth: true
      Layout.preferredHeight: 160
      radius: 12
      color: "#E3E3E3"
      clip: true

      Image {
        anchors.fill: parent
        source: root.imagePath
        fillMode: Image.PreserveAspectCrop
        visible: status === Image.Ready
      }

      Rectangle {
        visible: root.isMaintenance
        anchors.top: parent.top
        anchors.left: parent.left
        anchors.margins: 8
        width: badgeText.implicitWidth + 16
        height: badgeText.implicitHeight + 8
        radius: height / 2
        color: "#C0392B"

        Text {
          id: badgeText
          anchors.centerIn: parent
          text: "Under maintenance"
          font.pixelSize: 11
          font.weight: Font.DemiBold
          color: "white"
        }
      }
    }

    RowLayout {
      Layout.fillWidth: true

      Text {
        text: "Room " + root.number
        font.pixelSize: 18
        font.weight: Font.DemiBold
        color: "#1E1E1E"
      }

      Item { Layout.fillWidth: true }

      Text {
        text: root.tierName
        font.pixelSize: 12
        font.weight: Font.Medium
        color: "#6B6B6B"
      }
    }

    Text {
      Layout.fillWidth: true
      text: root.description
      font.pixelSize: 13
      color: "#6B6B6B"
      wrapMode: Text.WordWrap
      maximumLineCount: 2
      elide: Text.ElideRight
    }

    Text {
      text: "Sleeps " + root.capacity
      font.pixelSize: 12
      color: "#6B6B6B"
    }

    RowLayout {
      Layout.fillWidth: true

      Text {
        text: "$" + root.totalPrice.toFixed(2) + " / night"
        font.pixelSize: 15
        font.weight: Font.DemiBold
        color: "#1E1E1E"
      }

      Item { Layout.fillWidth: true }

      Text {
        text: root.reviewCount > 0
          ? "★ " + root.averageRating.toFixed(1) + " (" + root.reviewCount + ")"
          : "No reviews yet"
        font.pixelSize: 14
        color: "#6B6B6B"
      }
    }
  }

  // ─── Hover overlay: review previews ───
  Rectangle {
    id: overlay
    anchors.fill: parent
    radius: root.radius
    color: "#F9F9F9"

    visible: hover.hovered && !root.isMaintenance && root.reviewCount > 0

    Behavior on opacity {
      NumberAnimation {
        from: 0; to: 1
        duration: 150
        easing: Easing.InOutSine
      }
    }

    ColumnLayout {
      anchors.fill: parent
      anchors.margins: 16
      spacing: 8

      // Rating header
      RowLayout {
        Layout.fillWidth: true
        spacing: 6

        Text {
          text: "★"
          font.pixelSize: 20
          color: root.accent
        }

        Text {
          text: root.averageRating.toFixed(1)
          font.pixelSize: 22
          font.weight: Font.Bold
          color: "#1E1E1E"
        }

        Text {
          text: "(" + root.reviewCount + " review" + (root.reviewCount === 1 ? ")" : "s)")
          font.pixelSize: 13
          color: "#6B6B6B"
        }
      }

      // Review list — up to 3
      Repeater {
        model: root.previewReviews

        Rectangle {
          required property var modelData

          Layout.fillWidth: true
          implicitHeight: reviewText.implicitHeight + 24
          radius: 8
          color: "#EEEEEE"

          ColumnLayout {
            anchors.fill: parent
            anchors.margins: 10
            spacing: 4

            RowLayout {
              Layout.fillWidth: true
              spacing: 4

              Text {
                text: "★"
                font.pixelSize: 14
                color: modelData["rating"] >= 4 ? root.accent : "#6B6B6B"
              }

              Text {
                text: modelData["rating"].toFixed(1)
                font.pixelSize: 14
                font.weight: Font.DemiBold
                color: "#1E1E1E"
              }

              Item { Layout.fillWidth: true }

              Text {
                text: "— " + modelData["userName"]
                font.pixelSize: 11
                color: "#6B6B6B"
              }
            }

            Text {
              id: reviewText
              Layout.fillWidth: true
              text: "“" + modelData["text"] + "”"
              font.pixelSize: 12
              wrapMode: Text.WordWrap
              color: "#1E1E1E"
              maximumLineCount: 3
              elide: Text.ElideRight
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }

  HoverHandler {
    id: hover
    cursorShape: Qt.PointingHandCursor
  }
}
```

### What it does

- On hover, the overlay fades in over 150ms on top of the card
- Shows a **rating summary row** (star + average + count)
- Then iterates over `previewReviews` (max 3, sorted newest first) and renders each as a little bubble with rating, text snippet, and reviewer name
- Only shows if `reviewCount > 0` and the room isn't under maintenance
- The `previewReviews` property comes from the Python model — capped at 3 entries so you don't need to worry about limiting in QML
