Drop this after the reviews are created, before the `return`:

```python
# Book room 101 for a few days so it's unavailable in that window
_ = self._backend.add_reservation(
    user, 101,
    date(2025, 7, 10), date(2025, 7, 14)
)
```

Now when you call `searchAvailableRooms("2025-07-11", "2025-07-13", 1)` from the UI, room 101 won't show up. If you search dates that don't overlap (e.g. July 20–22), it will appear again.

Make sure you have `from datetime import date` at the top of `controller.py` — it's already imported in your current version, so you're good.
